  "query_preview": "..\nKEY MESSAGE 1...Convection ongoing across portions of the area\nearly this morning, extending from the Northern Outer Banks down\nthrough Jacksonville. Iso strong to severe storms with gusty\nwinds will be possible through the next hour or so, but\nweakening trend expected with area fairly worked over and \ndeveloping nocturnal CIN. \n\nKEY MESSAGE 2...Cold front will push offshore early this morning,\nwith sfc high pressure building in from the west while \ntroughing continues aloft. This will keep temps seasonable and \nmostly dry through late week. Iso showers/storms possible late\nthis afternoon and evening, mainly across the northern portions\nof the area as shortwave rotates through the base of the upper\ntrough. The next frontal system will impact the area this \nweekend into early next week, with increasing precip chances.",
